    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": "h1",
      "text": "Contact us"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "If you need information or have a general query, there are several ways to get in touch.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Find answers to some of our most common questions",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": "h3",
      "text": "Call"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "To speak to our Supporter Care team, call +44 (0)1444 446 600. Open Mon to Sun, 8am-10pm",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": "h3",
      "text": "Email"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We’re happy to deal with general enquiries via email. Send your messages to [email protected]",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "[email protected]",
          "href": "/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#3a53545c557a49535d524e495b4c5f48491455485d"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": "h3",
      "text": "Post"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Write to us at: Bumpers Way, Bumpers Farm Chippenham, SN14 6NG",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": "h3",
      "text": "Social media"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Connect with us to hear the latest news on Facebook, X, LinkedIn and Instagram",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Facebook",
          "href": "https://www.facebook.com/sightsavers"
        },
        {
          "text": "X",
          "href": "https://twitter.com/Sightsavers"
        },
        {
          "text": "LinkedIn",
          "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/sightsavers/"
        },
        {
          "text": "Instagram",
          "href": "https://www.instagram.com/sightsavers/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": "h3",
      "text": "Media enquiries"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We have a dedicated press office that deals with enquiries from the media. Visit our media centre",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Visit our media centre",
          "href": "/media-centre/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": "h3",
      "text": "More information"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For answers to some of the most common questions about Sightsavers, see our frequently asked questions",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "frequently asked questions",
          "href": "/contact-us/frequently-asked-questions/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": "h3",
      "text": "You’re important to us"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Sightsavers is committed to transparency and accountability. We aim to be open, frank and honest about all our work, and we make sure we explain everything we do so our supporters know how their money is being spent.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Our Speak Up reporting platform is a global way of reporting improper conduct, either online or by phone, and enables beneficiaries, employees, volunteers, partners and more to raise concerns about the conduct of Sightsavers and its staff.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Speak Up reporting platform",
          "href": "/how-were-run/accountability-and-transparency/speakup/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": "h2",
      "text": "Our policies"
    },
    {
